/-!
# Hodge theory of a fixed part

Positivity and index theorems for the pairing of the degree points of the arithmetic square:
its normal form as one matrix on the positive integers (jets, contacts, counterterm of the comb),
Zariski's lemma on a comb, the inequality of Castelnuovo and Severi at every finite scale on short
windows, the finiteness of the index of a window uniformly in the scale, Weil's form in the gauge
of the flat tail with the remainder of the prime number theorem as potential, the carry cocycle,
Riemann–Roch and Bézout on the tower of lines, the comb of unit masses as the datum that fixes
the contacts, and the classification of the separated combs stable under the Frobenius monoid.
See `HodgeTheoryOfAFixedPart/README.md`.
-/
